 baby monitors. They offer clear 1080p video and motion alerts for a fraction of the price (often under AED 100). The only downside is they don't have a dedicated parent screen; you must use your phone.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I use a security camera like Tapo or Ezviz as a baby monitor?\\\"}],\\\"intro\\\":\\\"Finding the right baby monitor in Dubai is tricky—concrete walls block WiFi, and AC hum affects audio. We tested the top 10 models for 2026 to find what actually works in UAE homes.\\\",\\\"listItems\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"d634860fc4de\\\",\\\"badgeLabel\\\":\\\"Best Overall (Smart)\\\",\\\"customVerdict\\\":null,\\\"product\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"product\\\",\\\"address\\\":null,\\\"affiliateLink\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/4jvjQk1\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"brand\\\":\\\"Nanit\\\",\\\"code\\\":null,\\\"cons\\\":[\\\"Expensive\\\",\\\"Dependent on WiFi stability\\\",\\\"Subscription needed for history\\\"],\\\"country\\\":null,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"curriculum\\\":null,\\\"customerRating\\\":4.5,\\\"entityType\\\":null,\\\"feeRange\\\":null,\\\"heroFeature\\\":null,\\\"keyFeatures\\\":[\\\"Sleep Tracking\\\",\\\"Breathing Monitoring\\\",\\\"1080p HD\\\",\\\"Split Screen\\\"],\\\"location\\\":null,\\\"mainImage\\\":{\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Nanit Pro smart baby monitor with floor stand over crib\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/781a8db217809e6f9744b3fb2f03fb459cdc7d1d-1260x1500.jpg\\\"},\\\"price\\\":2099,\\\"priceTier\\\":\\\"Premium\\\",\\\"pros\\\":[\\\"Incredible picture quality\\\",\\\"Background audio\\\",\\\"No wearables on baby\\\",\\\"Peace of mind stats\\\"],\\\"rating\\\":4.5,\\\"realityCheck\\\":null,\\\"retailer\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\",\\\"reviewCount\\\":2273,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"nanit-pro-smart-baby-monitor-uae\\\",\\\"specifications\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Nanit Pro Smart Baby Monitor\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"The \\\\\\\"