ck concrete villa walls where WiFi fails.\"},{\"_key\":\"05b1c426200d\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Ultra Budget\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/49HOFi9\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Imou\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"No background play\",\"Limited vertical angle\",\"Subscription nag\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.2,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"1080p\",\"AI Human Detection\",\"360° View\",\"Two-way Talk\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Imou 360 degree indoor security camera white\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/a60efc82228d33f24e48d16f2e46b2db9bed94e1-1184x1175.jpg\"},\"price\":65.55,\"priceTier\":\"Budget\",\"pros\":[\"Very affordable\",\"Good picture quality\",\"Motion tracking\"],\"rating\":4.2,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":268,\"slug\":\"imou-1080p-security-camera-dk2--baby-monitor\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Imou 1080P Security Camera (DK2)\",\"verdict\":\"An incredibly cheap monitoring solution, but lacks background audio (app must stay open).\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":4,\"whySelected\":\"A solid 1080p camera for the price of a lunch.\"},{\"_key\":\"86739a5bbb6d\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Battery Life\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4svwVxJ\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"VTech\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Small screen\",\"Low resolution (480p)\",\"Charging issues reported\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.6,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"19-Hour Battery\",\"Temperature Sensor\",\"1000ft Range\",\"No WiFi\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"VTech VM819 portable baby m